{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Runs a saved FLOW command once and reports which cases of its nextcase chain ran. P5: the run is ONE debug session over the stepper (dev.flowstep debug_start + debug_step continue + debug_state + debug_stop) — the same interpreter path the editor's run button and the debugger ride; the sentinel-nextcase mechanism is retired. Returns {status, result, path, cases}: result is the envelope a plain run returns (same auth check and format_result as app.app.exec); path is [{case, end, ms}], one per case executed, root first — end is next (a next rule fired), done, terminate, fail, stall, or panic — walked off the run's event stream (per-case ms summed from the events). A next rule firing in the last case ends the chain. Runs the SAVED body. Inputs: lib, ctl, cmd name the flow command; args are its arguments (JSONObject); nn_sessionid is filled in by the framework (pass \"\" from javascript). Admin-only.","import":"use flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse flowlang::command::Command;\nuse ndata::dataobject::DataObject;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\nuse std::panic;\nuse crate::app::service::init::format_result;\nuse crate::security::security::init::check_auth;","params":[{"name":"lib","type":"String"},{"name":"ctl","type":"String"},{"name":"cmd","type":"String"},{"name":"args","type":"JSONObject"},{"name":"nn_sessionid","type":"String"}],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"msuuqu1a165e00598r1161","readers":[],"time":1792795170431,"username":"system","writers":[]}